{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b7973e65-b0f5-8c5b-a9c6-17cfc1a7da54",
  "created_at": "2026-01-16T13:57:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rocco Fiore",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:53:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:53:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hey, hi. Sorry, I'm gonna keep my voice down, I'm kind of in a place where I can't really talk loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:53:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. I can barely hear you, hon. Can you get the phone a little closer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:53:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, is that better? I'm calling about the drain on my street. Kay Street. It's wicked bad and it keeps happening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:53:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little better. Kay Street. What's the house number, or the nearest one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:53:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "273 Kay Street. Up in the Historic Hill area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:53:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "273 Kay Street. Okay. And what's going on with the drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:53:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So there's water coming out of a pipe at the curb, right in front of the house. Just running out, constantly. And it's not even raining. It hasn't rained in days, totally dry out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:54:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Water coming out of a pipe at the curb, and no rain. Is it coming from the storm drain, or from a pipe sticking out of the curb itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:54:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Out of the curb, like a little pipe. And then it runs across the sidewalk and, with the cold, it freezes. [pause] It's a sheet of ice now. Like a skating rink. Somebody's gonna wipe out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:54:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Is it the whole width of the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:54:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the whole thing. Wall to curb. People are walking out in the street to get around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:54:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Have you noticed how long it's been going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:54:52-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Like a week and a half, honestly. Yesterday I went out and cleared the leaves off the grate by hand, all the wet stuff packed in there. [line breaks up] And it helped, totally, for like ten minutes. Then it just backed up again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:55:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up on me there. You cleared the leaves off the grate by hand, and it helped for how long?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:55:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ten minutes. Maybe. Then it was right back to the same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:55:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ten minutes, got it. So the grate is clear on top but it's still backing up and running out at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:55:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. So I'm thinking something's clogged down in there, below where I can reach. I just want somebody to come clean the drain out. That's all I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:55:47-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll put in a request for the drain to be cleaned and checked, at 273 Kay Street, with the ice on the sidewalk noted. Since it's an ice hazard I'll mark that on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:56:01-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Because honestly, this isn't the first I've said something about it. I mentioned it to a neighbor and they said it's been like this off and on. Nobody ever comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:56:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I don't see anything open on that address from what I'm looking at, so I'll get this one started fresh. Do you want a call back when it's scheduled?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:56:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'd be good. It's 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:56:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0194. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:56:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:56:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And you're the homeowner there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:56:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I own the place. Rocco Fiore."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:56:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rocco Fiore, 273 Kay Street. Water running from the curb pipe with no rain, freezing on the sidewalk, grate hand-cleaned but backs up again. Did I get it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:56:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Exactly. Can you maybe get somebody out today? Before it gets dark and everything refreezes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:57:02-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll flag it as a hazard so it gets looked at early. Today is possible, but I'd say it's more likely the crew gets to it early next week at the latest. In the meantime, a little salt or sand on the sidewalk will help people get by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:57:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, okay. I've got some salt. It's just gonna keep making more ice though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:57:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It might, yes. If it gets worse or somebody falls, call us right back and we'll bump it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:57:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Alright, I gotta go. Thanks, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:57:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Rocco. Have a good weekend."
    }
  ],
